        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Along with Greenstone Biosciences Inc., we continue to evaluate other collaborators, partners and business opportunities to accelerate development without taking away from the core clinical programs.",
        "start_character": 10234,
        "end_character": 10433
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the event we develop processes, products or services which qualify as medical devices subject to FDA regulation, we intend to comply with such regulations.",
        "start_character": 65780,
        "end_character": 65938
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Unlike our CaverStem®, FemCelz® and StemSpine® procedures, because the patient’s cells are reprogrammed/supercharged prior to reinjection, we will require FDA approval before we can market or sell products that use our ImmCelz™ (CELZ-100) technology.",
        "start_character": 20097,
        "end_character": 20347
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe these results show that we will be able to substantially reduce production costs, while allowing for the manufacture of the best clinical product for patients with immune disorders, which will enable us to accelerate our clinical applications and encourage potential collaborations with respect to our ImmCelz™ platform.",
        "start_character": 4988,
        "end_character": 5319
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have developed and acquired a robust intellectual property portfolio related to the utilization of stem cells to improve patient lives in the areas of urology, neurology, and orthopedics.",
        "start_character": 31133,
        "end_character": 31323
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In August, 2025 we announced the FDA granted Fast Track designation to its lead investigational therapy, CELZ-201-DDT.",
        "start_character": 12930,
        "end_character": 13048
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In March 2023, we announced that we had filed an application with the FDA to receive Orphan Drug Designation (“ODD”) for the treatment of Brittle Type 1 Diabetes using its ImmCelz™ (CELZ-100) platform.",
        "start_character": 5320,
        "end_character": 5521
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In May 2023, we announced that we had received confirmation that Greenstone had successfully developed a human induced pluripotent stem cell (iPSC).",
        "start_character": 2317,
        "end_character": 2465
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In October 2022, we announced the development of our AlloStem™ Clinical Cell Line (CELZ-200), a proprietary allogenic cell line which includes a Master Cell Bank and a Drug Master File.",
        "start_character": 2922,
        "end_character": 3107
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Subsequently, we have expanded our development and acquisition of intellectual property beyond urology to include therapeutic treatments utilizing “re-programmed” stem cells, and the treatment of neurologic disorders, lower back pain, Type-1 diabetes, and heart, liver, kidney, and other diseases using various types of stem cells through our ImmCelz, Inc., StemSpine, Inc.",
        "start_character": 519,
        "end_character": 892
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "To execute this initiative, we entered into an agreement with Greenstone Biosciences, Inc., as the exclusive AI and iPSC development partner.",
        "start_character": 13660,
        "end_character": 13801
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001477932-26-001517",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001477932-26-001517-c43c41695686345b",
        "accession_number": "0001477932-26-001517",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are developing our ImmCelz™ (CELZ-100) technology for the treatment of multiple indications.",
